{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんにちは！\n新内眞衣です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年のバレンタインは土曜日！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という事で、\n我が社では本日金曜日にお渡しします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女性の上司が気を遣ってくれて\nお金集めてまとめて送ろうと提案\nしてくれたので、\nそこに乗っかっちゃいました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会社ってやっぱり人が多いし\n1人1人に用意するのも大変だから\n結構そういう会社、\n多いのでは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会社の義理チョコ事情\n良かったら教えてね(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも男性はやっぱり\nたくさん貰うほうが嬉しいのかな？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週末は2日連続握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは土曜日のスペシャル個握！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部 走れ!Bicycle"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2期生 初ステージの思い出の衣装\n最初はこれにするって決めてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね！\n1部でBicycleは深川さんと\n2人だけだったから記念に"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部 13日の金曜日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2周年の時は紫だったから\n水色来てみた(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い衣装着るとアイドル！って\n感じがするよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装で握手会は初めてだから\nとても新鮮でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージで見るのとまた違った\n見え方が出来たんじゃないかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は2部制になってしまい\n皆さんに会える時間が少なくなって\nしまったけど、\n在る時間を大切に過ごしたいと\n思えた握手会でした(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は何着ようかな？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続いて\n10thラストの個握！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンピース：\nLIMITLESS LUXURY"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型：ショート風"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニット：EDDY GRACE"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカート：Lily Brown"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型：ポニーテール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部と同じワンピース。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も私服は3部とも雰囲気変えたよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部のが人気だったかな？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10枚目の最後となりましたが、\n本当に充実した握手会になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめての方も常連さんも\nアンダーライブの話や\nカフェの話\nのぎ天の話など、\n話題に尽きなくて\n楽しかったよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう！\n11枚目もいろんなお話しようね(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"只今、ある計画を企んでいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーにもアンケート取ったり\nしてるんだけど、\nまとめて何かを考えるって難しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部採用したいくらい（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしててね〜( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！今日はこの辺で！\nまた書きます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0015.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}